# What is built, not what is written.
#
# listening_ai was never committed, so nothing was ever keeping the build tree
# out: 170 untracked files, of which the biggest were a 66 MB debug APK and
# eight copies of libonnxruntime.so from the intermediates. The sources and the
# model assets are what a checkout needs; everything below is remade by
# `build.ps1`.

app/build/
.gradle/

# Machine-specific: sdk.dir and the JDK path belong to whoever is building, and
# build.ps1 resolves them itself.
local.properties

# Compiled by hand for the offline dumps (tools/ListeningDump.java).
tools/out/
*.class

__pycache__/
